                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The vein went quiet when you won. That is its way of tipping the hat. Go south — the deep stone is waiting."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I marked this bench with your battle. The stone keeps better records than the Company ever will."
                        }
                    ],
