                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Quiet on this bench. Good. The veins talk under the stone here and I have learned to listen. They said somebody with badges was coming up the road. They are never wrong."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Most miners follow the ore. I follow the vein under the ore — the one that hums. It hums louder when a strong trainer stands on it. It is very loud right now."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Stone remembers pressure. So do I. Put some pressure on me and see what the bench remembers of you."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Darrik Stonevein",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
